{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/20/0873696/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブレポは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また別記事で✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さん卒業おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/20/0873696/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃんを食らう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さんとの出会いは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂加入前の電車の中(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ヲタだった私が電車に乗ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前にねねころがああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま同じ駅で降りたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してます！とだけ声を掛けたのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でも鮮明に覚えています(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂加入前から勝手に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さんとはテンション感とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合いそうだな～って思ってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"加入して話してみたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりすごく話しやすくて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/